1- You may come across the following error: 

FAILED: ChromeDevToolsProtocol.ChromeDevTools.E_Extract_Nework_Responses_StatusCode.extractNetworkResponses
org.openqa.selenium.devtools.DevToolsException: {"id":1,"error":{"code":-32601,"message":"'Network.enable' wasn't found"}}

To fix it: Include the below dependency:


<!-- https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.seleniumhq.selenium/selenium-devtools-v113 -->

<dependency>

    <groupId>org.seleniumhq.selenium</groupId>

    <artifactId>selenium-devtools-v113</artifactId>

    <version>4.9.1</version>

</dependency>
